      "output": "```js\nconst BALANCE={\nstart:{gold:120,lives:20},sellRefund:0.7,earlyBonus:1,betweenWaves:20,\ntowers:{\narrow:{levels:[{cost:45,damage:12,range:9,rate:1.25,projectileSpeed:30},{cost:70,damage:18,range:10,rate:1.6,projectileSpeed:32},{cost:110,damage:28,range:11,rate:2,projectileSpeed:35}]},\nfrost:{slow:{factor:0.5,seconds:2},splash:1.8,levels:[{cost:60,damage:6,range:8,rate:1,projectileSpeed:14},{cost:75,damage:10,range:9,rate:1.1,projectileSpeed:15},{cost:115,damage:16,range:10,rate:1.2,projectileSpeed:16}]},\ncannon:{splash:2.6,levels:[{cost:75,damage:40,range:9,rate:0.5,projectileSpeed:12},{cost:100,damage:70,range:10,rate:0.55,projectileSpeed:13},{cost:150,damage:110,range:11,rate:0.6,projectileSpeed:14}]}},\nenemies:{runner:{hp:30,speed:3.4,armour:0,bounty:4,leak:1},grunt:{hp:50,speed:2,armour:0,bounty:6,leak:1},shield:{hp:90,speed:1.4,armour:4,bounty:9,leak:2},boss:{hp:4000,speed:0.75,armour:8,bounty:150,leak:15}},\nwaves:[\n{hpMul:1,groups:[{kind:\"grunt\",count:8,interval:1.6,delay:0}]},\n{hpMul:1.1,groups:[{kind:\"runner\",count:8,interval:0.9,delay:0},{kind:\"grunt\",count:3,interval:1.5,delay:9}]},\n{hpMul:1.2,groups:[{kind:\"grunt\",count:10,interval:1.3,delay:0},{kind:\"shield\",count:3,interval:2.5,delay:12}]},\n{hpMul:1.35,groups:[{kind:\"runner\",count:12,interval:0.8,delay:0},{kind:\"shield\",count:3,interval:2.2,delay:8}]},\n{hpMul:1.5,groups:[{kind:\"grunt\",count:12,interval:1.1,delay:0},{kind:\"shield\",count:6,interval:2,delay:6}]},\n{hpMul:1.7,groups:[{kind:\"runner\",count:16,interval:0.6,delay:0},{kind:\"shield\",count:8,interval:1.8,delay:6}]},\n{hpMul:1.9,groups:[{kind:\"grunt\",count:18,interval:0.9,delay:0},{kind:\"shield\",count:10,interval:1.6,delay:5}]},\n{hpMul:2.1,groups:[{kind:\"shield\",count:14,interval:1.4,delay:0},{kind:\"runner\",count:18,interval:0.5,delay:8}]},\n{hpMul:2.3,groups:[{kind:\"grunt\",count:24,interval:0.8,delay:0},{kind:\"shield\",count:18,interval:1.2,delay:6}]},\n{hpMul:2.5,groups:[{kind:\"boss\",count:1,interval:0,delay:0},{kind:\"grunt\",count:12,interval:1,delay:4},{kind:\"shield\",count:8,interval:1.8,delay:10}]}]};\n```\n\n1. **Game flow:** Title (How to play) → Build (a countdown of betweenWaves seconds; tap pads to build) → Wave n → between waves (countdown) → … → clearing wave 10 = Win, and 0 lives = Lose. Both end screens show stats and Play again.\n2. **Wave spawning:** Each group starts `delay` seconds after the wave begins. It spawns `count` enemies, one every `interval` seconds. Each enemy has hp = base hp × hpMul. A wave ends when every enemy has been killed or has leaked.\n3. **Calling a wave early:** \"Next wave\" starts the wave and pays floor(earlyBonus × seconds left on the countdown). The wave starts automatically when the countdown reaches 0.\n4. **Building, upgrading and selling:** levels[0].cost is the build price, and levels[1] and levels[2] cost the price of each upgrade. Selling refunds floor(sellRefund × all gold spent on that tower).\n5. **Damage:**\n   - Each hit deals max(1, damage − armour).\n   - Splash hits every enemy within `splash` metres of the impact.\n   - Frost multiplies an enemy's speed by slow.factor for slow.seconds. A new hit refreshes the slow; slows do not stack.\n6. **Targeting:** Each tower fires at the enemy furthest along the path within its range. Projectiles home in on their target at projectileSpeed.\n7. **Rewards and leaks:** A kill pays its bounty. An enemy that reaches the crystal removes `leak` lives and pays nothing. Pause freezes the game, and 2× speed doubles all timers, including the countdown.\n8. **Unverified estimate (by hand, not playtested):**\n   - An idle player falls to 1 life after wave 2 and dies in wave 3.\n   - A careful player has about 546 gold by wave 6, enough for about 9 towers.\n   - Winning with about 3 lives to spare needs a playtest."
