      "output": "# Review record: Crystal Keep\n\n**Status: not actually run.** This review is based only on reading the HTML source. No browser session, rendering, input test or playtest was performed.\n\n**Confirmed in the source (static review):**\n- **BALANCE:** the object matches the \"Rules and balance\" upstream output exactly.\n- **Waves:** each wave queues `delay + k·interval` per group. Enemy hp is `round(hp·hpMul)`. A wave ends when the spawn queue and the enemy list are both empty.\n- **Economy:** build, upgrade and sell costs follow `levels[]`. Sell pays `floor(0.7·spent)`. Calling early pays `floor(earlyBonus·countdown)`. The wave starts automatically when the countdown reaches 0.\n- **Combat:**\n  - Damage is `max(1,damage−armour)`.\n  - Splash uses the radius around the impact point.\n  - Frost sets `slowUntil=now+2`, which refreshes the slow and does not stack, with factor 0.5.\n  - Towers target the enemy furthest along the path within range. Kills pay the bounty.\n- **Leaks and endings:** a leak subtracts `leak` lives and pays nothing. 0 lives loses; clearing wave 10 wins. Both end screens show stats and Play again.\n- **Pause and speed:** pause sends `gd=0`. 2× scales every timer, including the countdown.\n- **Interface:** the build menu has 3 towers and buttons are disabled when gold is short. Max level disables the upgrade button.\n- **Input:** pointer events with `touch-action:none`, a 6 px tap threshold, drag limited to ±35°, and wheel and pinch zoom.\n- **External requests:** the only one is the three.js r128 script from cdnjs. A `CapsuleGeometry` fallback is present.\n\n**Defects found:**\n1. **Play again does not reset everything.** `case'again':wipe();state=createGame(…);startGame(state);paused=false;…` leaves `speed` (2× persists), `ty`/`td` (camera) and in-flight fx unchanged.\n2. **Projectiles do not home.** The hit time is fixed at fire (`sec=bd/L.projectileSpeed`). The visual shot (`fx.shot(…,to,…)`) flies to the position at fire time, while damage lands on the target's later position.\n3. **Pause does not freeze actions.** While paused, `act('wave')`, `build`, `upgrade`, `sell` and the keys `N/1/2/3/U/S` still work.\n4. **Shots from sold towers still land.** Pending shots remain in `s.pending` after the tower is sold.\n5. **Some gold changes have no floating number.** The early bonus and sell refund change gold silently: the sell refund only spawns coin particles, and the early bonus shows nothing.\n6. **Pad hover is never set.** The `'hover'` pad state is defined but never assigned (cosmetic).\n\n**Unverified items:**\n- The visuals and the golden-hour look, shadows and performance.\n- Real touch and pinch on devices, and audio unlock on iOS.\n- That the CDN loads.\n- Whether the non-BALANCE modules (world, tower, enemy, fx, game, audio, HUD, wiring) match their upstream deliveries. Only BALANCE could be compared here.\n- The balance estimates: the idle loss in wave 3, about 546 gold by wave 6, and a win with about 3 lives. These need a playtest."
